Package: LIPS
Title: LIPS (Linear Inverse Problem Sampler)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Linus", "Fromm", , "froli465@student.otago.ac.nz", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package employs multiple linear inverse problem samplers. Some improve mixing rates of standard tools and some are simple explorations of different approaches. For all of them the underlying set that is sampled from is the fibre. This package is developed in conjunction with my (Linus Fromm) PhD thesis.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
